Package: pdscox
Type: Package
Title: Pathway Deregulation Scores with Cox-LASSO for Relapse Prognosis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("fossil", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@github.com")
Description: Rebuilds the prognosis model of Huang, Yee, Ching, Yu and Garmire (2014,
    PLoS Comput Biol 10:e1003851, doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1003851): gene expression is turned
    into pathway deregulation scores with 'pathifier', a Cox model with an L1 (LASSO) penalty is
    fitted with 'penalized', the penalty is chosen by repeated likelihood cross-validation, and
    samples are split into higher and lower risk groups by the prognostic index. Also the
    gene-based, clinical and combined models, the log-rank test and the ROC AUC used to compare
    them. The authors' code is lost; the method is rebuilt from the paper's text.
